Welcome to the Advanced Typer 1.2 update! 

What's New:

1. Simplified Language Selection: We have removed the hassle of selecting a separate language for offline typing. Now, your offline voice typing will automatically sync with your main voice dictation language.

2. Smoother Offline Experience: We have improved the offline microphone stability. If the mic ever struggles to catch your voice, it instantly recovers in the background so your typing continues without any breaks.

3. Enhanced Device Support: The system has been upgraded to work flawlessly with modern Android devices, ensuring faster and more reliable offline typing when your connection drops.

4. Improved Language Switching: The voice command feature has been refined. Switching from Arabic to any other language is now much smoother and more accurate.

5. Better Settings Menu: We have improved the overall performance of the settings menu to give you a highly responsive and glitch-free experience.

